The '''Forgotten Island''' is the final [[Locations|island]] in the [[Second Sea]].

==Appearance==
The Forgotten Island is relatively large, consisting of one big mainland on a cliff with houses on it, a decent-sized beach, and an enormous skull in front of the cliff. There is another mini island behind the cliff mainland, where the [[Tide Keeper]] spawns.

==Location==
The Forgotten Island is located in between [[Snow Mountain]] and [[Hot and Cold]], in the [[Second Sea]].

