==Chests==
Forgotten Island has a total of 9 [[chests]]:
* 3 Silver Chests
* 5 Golden Chests
* 1 Diamond Chest

==Trivia==
* The Forgotten Island has a high number of exploiters farming [[Water Fighter]]s, so it is recommended to try to use codes for 2x XP to pass this island as soon as possible, or use a private server.
** Due to the large number of exploiters, the Forgotten Island is also one of the best places to kill them and get lots of [[Bounty and Honor System|Bounty/Honor]].

